  "announcement": {
    "id": "v4.10.9",
    "level": "info",
    "showOnce": true,
    "msg_id": "ARA 4.10.9 — Plugin SketchUp makin mudah: salah langkah kini memunculkan kartu cara pakai di layar, Garis sejajar bisa diubah sesudah diklik, dan Kisi/Ubin/Perforasi tampil sebagai garis pratinjau dulu sehingga mengubah angka jauh lebih cepat. Update terpasang otomatis saat aplikasi dibuka.",
    "msg_en": "ARA 4.10.9 — The SketchUp plugins got easier: a wrong step now shows a how-to card on screen, parallel lines can still be changed after the click, and Slats/Tiles/Perforation show a preview outline first, so changing numbers is much faster. The update installs automatically when the app opens."
  }
